board of directors and agreed to by Jade, of one new share of Aerovate common stock for every 20 to 120 shares (or any number in between)
of outstanding Aerovate common stock in the form attached as Annex B to the Proxy Statement (the &#8220;Reverse Stock Split Proposal&#8221;).</i></p>

